{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "intro-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 📦 Poblado de la Base de Datos\n",
    "Este notebook inserta datos de prueba en todas las tablas del esquema.\n",
    "El orden importa: primero las tablas independientes (sin FK) y luego las dependientes.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Orden de inserción:**\n",
    "1. `Patient` — sin dependencias\n",
    "2. `Staff` — sin dependencias\n",
    "3. `SampleType` — sin dependencias\n",
    "4. `Container` — sin dependencias\n",
    "5. `ResearchProject` — sin dependencias\n",
    "6. `Protocol` — depende de `Staff`\n",
    "7. `Sample` — depende de `Patient`, `SampleType`, `Container`\n",
    "8. `LogTemperature` — depende de `Sample`\n",
    "9. `QualityControl` — depende de `Sample`\n",
    "10. `ResearchProjectSamples` — depende de `Sample` y `ResearchProject`\n",
    "11. `ProjectTeam` — depende de `Staff` y `ResearchProject`\n",
    "12. `sample_protocol` (N:M) — depende de `Sample` y `Protocol`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "c8bd86df",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "# Configurar rutas para que el Notebook encuentre la carpeta 'src'\n",
    "# Asumiendo que la estructura es: biotrack/notebooks/archivo.ipynb\n",
    "current_dir = Path(os.getcwd())\n",
    "project_root = current_dir.parent  # Sube a la raíz 'biotrack'\n",
    "src_path = str(project_root / \"src\")\n",
    "\n",
    "if src_path not in sys.path:\n",
    "    sys.path.append(src_path)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "300bb396",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "import os\n",
    "if os.getcwd().endswith(\"notebooks\"):\n",
    "    os.chdir(\"..\")\n",
    "sys.path.append(\"src\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "adf62593",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "✅ Configuration loaded: development -> sqlite:///C:\\Users\\Usuario\\Desktop\\biotrack\\data\\biotrack.db\n",
      "✅ ¡Conexión exitosa! Ya puedes usar tus modelos.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from datetime import date, datetime\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    from domain import (Base, engine, Session)\n",
    "    from domain import (\n",
    "        Patient, Staff, SampleType, Container,\n",
    "        ResearchProject, Sample, Protocol,\n",
    "        LogTemperature, QualityControl,\n",
    "        ResearchProjectSamples, ProjectTeam\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    from domain import (BaseRepository, ResearchProjectRepository)\n",
    "    Base.metadata.create_all(engine)\n",
    "    print(\"✅ ¡Conexión exitosa! Ya puedes usar tus modelos.\")\n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print(f\"❌ Error al importar: {e}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "helper-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🛠️ Función auxiliar de inserción\n",
    "Para evitar duplicados usamos un patrón común en todos los bloques:\n",
    "1. Consulta los registros existentes y los indexa por su campo único\n",
    "2. Solo inserta los que no existen aún\n",
    "3. Hace `commit` al final de cada bloque"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "patient-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
